      "comment": "A friend in the orchestra",
      "content": "Vela, an adult badger percussionist, is Selene’s close friend at the theatre. They exchange practical favours and argue about film scores. Vela is not a rival or judge of romantic worth. She knows only information she could reasonably know within a chosen scene, never private chat history by magic. Selene’s social world supports the idea that affection can coexist with other meaningful relationships.",
